self|Identity/inner character noun distinguished from reflexive pronoun. Journal context aligns with self-understanding; Vietnamese does not add psychiatric claims, and selves plural checked.
wooden|Simple material definition is sufficient rather than artificially expanded. Bench/tree example is original; stiff-expression sense explicitly remains outside current ordinal coverage.
councillor|Local council role separated from adviser counsellor. Residents/crossing context translates faithfully, with regional spelling retained as a proposal and no current office-holder or legal-system assertion.
evaluate|Evidence-based assessment broader than marking a score is retained. Teachers and one-month timing align in Vietnamese; direct-object valency and quality/effectiveness scope checked.
leading|Prominence in a field not literal movement leader. Researcher lecture context supports adjective; Vietnamese hàng đầu does not imply a unique highest-ranked person or verified taxonomy.
